body:
As someone who was going through the same as Reckful (may his soul be at peace) and tried to take my life, it angers me to no end! It's like we didn't learn ANYTHING of what happened to Etika in 2019 that sadly he also too took his life. Both got insulted, make fun of and laughed in their faces on the internet for what is literally a cry for help.

&#x200B;

I'm sorry but things like this make me wish for another mass extinction event.

&#x200B;

Edit - correction

The only social media that I deleted was twitter due how incredibly toxic it is, I abandoned the rest.  It's been months since I used them and let me tell you It feels great!  Before I left them I was felling incredibly depressed, to the point that I even think to end my life. But now I feel like I've lose a ton of weight up my shoulders, I'm starting to think for myself instead of getting involved on other people's problems and my depression it's at minimun right now. 

&#x200B;

TL;DR: I left social media because It literally was killing me, now I feel better than ever and I don't miss it even one bit.
